From 841fd038a11e061046ec9406682cb0cf90485c90 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robin Lintermann <rl@karo-electronics.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:00:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] board: karo: add i.MX95 module family support

Add the board code for Ka-Ro electronics i.MX95 solder-in modules in
board/karo/imx95/ with SPL, board specific imx_get_mac_from_fuse()
and SCMI power domain handling, plus the TARGET_KARO_IMX95 target and
Kconfig wiring and the common i.MX95 config header.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [karo-specific]
Signed-off-by: Robin Lintermann <rl@karo-electronics.de>

